00:13:18.930 --> 00:13:20.580
Girls, we must hurry!

00:13:21.130 --> 00:13:23.320
The birthday girl will arrive at any moment!

00:13:24.500 --> 00:13:27.130
A birthday party for me?

00:13:27.130 --> 00:13:30.010
But why would they keep it a secret?

00:13:30.010 --> 00:13:32.590
Because they wanted you to enjoy the surprise.

00:13:34.090 --> 00:13:35.260
Grandmother!

00:13:35.640 --> 00:13:38.250
Since you've never had a birthday,

00:13:38.250 --> 00:13:41.240
they put their hearts into making your first one unforgettable.

00:13:44.780 --> 00:13:45.710
Girls...

00:13:46.100 --> 00:13:48.310
Now, let's go inside.

00:13:48.310 --> 00:13:51.170
But pretend you don't know about the party.

00:13:51.170 --> 00:13:52.920
It's no fun if you're not surprised.

00:13:55.660 --> 00:13:56.350
Okay!

00:13:57.670 --> 00:14:00.800
Happy birthday, Aguri!

00:14:00.800 --> 00:14:02.200
Happy birthday!

00:14:02.200 --> 00:14:03.610
Surprised, huh?

00:14:04.780 --> 00:14:05.950
Happy birthday!

00:14:08.410 --> 00:14:11.060
Okay Aguri, blow out the candles!

00:14:15.080 --> 00:14:17.170
Happy birthday!

00:14:18.740 --> 00:14:20.550
Thank you very much!

00:14:29.710 --> 00:14:34.830
Grandmother, I never knew that birthday cakes were <i>this</i> delicious!

00:14:34.830 --> 00:14:36.730
Glad you enjoy it.

00:14:36.970 --> 00:14:37.930
I do!

00:14:37.930 --> 00:14:40.960
I want to have a birthday every day now!

00:14:41.300 --> 00:14:44.670
I came all this way just to see it reserved for a birthday party?

00:14:44.670 --> 00:14:46.940
And those lucky brats get cake...

00:14:49.310 --> 00:14:52.010
Oh well, I'll go somewhere else.

00:14:53.980 --> 00:14:57.180
Just squash that cake.

00:14:57.660 --> 00:14:58.450
