Ai!

00:15:26.670 --> 00:15:29.190
Daddy! Mommy! Grandpa!

00:15:31.590 --> 00:15:32.450
Had it comin'.

00:15:32.440 --> 00:15:33.910
Regina!

00:15:34.690 --> 00:15:36.150
Why did you do this?

00:15:36.140 --> 00:15:39.030
Hm, now why did I, again?

00:15:39.030 --> 00:15:41.620
There was this book Mana read to me.

00:15:41.620 --> 00:15:46.790
It had a witch who put the princess into eternal slumber because she wasn't invited to a party...

00:15:47.160 --> 00:15:48.640
"Sleeping Beauty"?

00:15:48.630 --> 00:15:50.370
Yeah, that one!

00:15:50.370 --> 00:15:51.650
I'm the witch.

00:15:51.650 --> 00:15:53.730
The witch who nobody saved a slice for!

00:15:54.160 --> 00:15:56.820
Aguri, we'll handle her!

00:15:56.820 --> 00:15:58.070
Take Mari and run!

00:15:59.030 --> 00:16:00.530
Let's go, Grandmother!

00:16:01.960 --> 00:16:05.210
We should be able to return everyone to normal by purifying the Selfish!

00:16:05.210 --> 00:16:06.040
Let's go!

00:16:06.860 --> 00:16:08.660
Charles!

00:16:09.960 --> 00:16:12.750
Precure Love Link!

00:16:13.080 --> 00:16:13.770
