L-O-V-E!

00:16:15.160 --> 00:16:16.260
L-O-V-E!

00:16:20.830 --> 00:16:23.040
Oh poor ant who has lost his love,

00:16:23.570 --> 00:16:25.270
I, Cure Heart,

00:16:25.260 --> 00:16:28.770
will make your heart race once more!

00:16:29.650 --> 00:16:31.420
Let's rock, Precures!

00:16:31.420 --> 00:16:34.270
