00:16:53.880 --> 00:16:54.730
Aguri!

00:16:54.730 --> 00:16:56.410
I'll be fine!

00:16:56.410 --> 00:16:57.770
Now hurry!

00:17:01.640 --> 00:17:02.770
I understand.

00:17:05.160 --> 00:17:06.710
Don't get hurt, okay?

00:17:12.330 --> 00:17:14.160
Let's go, Ai!

00:17:15.610 --> 00:17:18.150
Precure Dress Up!

00:17:18.580 --> 00:17:20.410
Kyupirappa!

00:18:06.000 --> 00:18:06.810
You again?

00:18:07.810 --> 00:18:09.570
Love's trump card,

00:18:09.570 --> 00:18:11.070
Cure Ace!

00:18:13.220 --> 00:18:15.530
Beauty is the mark of the righteous!

00:18:16.640 --> 00:18:18.200
With a single wink,

00:18:18.200 --> 00:18:21.380
I shall pierce your heart!

00:18:23.040 --> 00:18:24.450
Cure Ace!

00:18:31.880 --> 00:18:33.420
You tick me off!

00:18:41.400 --> 00:18:44.430
So, you get to eat cake with everyone?

00:18:45.050 --> 00:18:47.440
You think you were always part of the group?!

00:18:47.440 --> 00:18:48.350
Huh?

00:18:48.840 --> 00:18:50.140
It's worthless!

00:18:50.520 --> 00:18:54.630
We'd all be better off without you!

00:18:57.920 --> 00:19:00.290
It is not... worthless!

00:19:01.330 --> 00:19:02.060
Mana!

00:19:02.390 --> 00:19:05.700
The birth of a new life is a miracle!

00:19:06.090 --> 00:19:06.760
You,

00:19:07.080 --> 00:19:07.730
me,

00:19:08.070 --> 00:19:09.340
Aguri...

00:19:09.620 --> 00:19:13.800
Everyone deserves to be celebrated!

00:19:14.690 --> 00:19:16.240
Cure Heart...

00:19:18.760 --> 00:19:20.900
That tingling pain again...

00:19:21.570 --> 00:19:22.610
Why?

00:19:23.070 --> 00:19:24.380
Sadface...

00:19:24.820 --> 00:19:26.330
Cure Heart...

00:19:26.330 --> 00:19:28.160
It's all because of you...

00:19:28.160 --> 00:19:30.520
I hate you!

00:19:33.790 --> 00:19:34.940
Cure Ace!

00:19:34.940 --> 00:19:37.290
I accept your feelings!

00:19:37.290 --> 00:19:38.610
Now let us counterattack!

00:19:38.610 --> 00:19:39.400
Yeah!

00:19:39.390 --> 00:19:40.960
Oh no you ain't!

00:19:43.180 --> 00:19:46.160
Diamond Swirkle!

00:19:49.670 --> 00:19:52.200
Lie there and cool your hot head down!

00:19:52.200 --> 00:19:53.780
Kiddin' me...

00:19:54.110 --> 00:19:54.610
Self!

00:19:55.120 --> 00:19:56.510
Selfiiiiish!

00:19:57.090 --> 00:19:58.450
Girls, let's go!

00:19:58.450 --> 00:19:59.390
Right!

00:20:08.000 --> 00:20:09.840
Kyupirappa!

00:20:35.580 --> 00:20:40.640
Precure Royal Lovely Straight Flush!

00:20:53.260 --> 00:20:56.320
Love love looooove!

00:21:14.370 --> 00:21:15.790
Cripes!

00:21:15.790 --> 00:21:18.530
Precures, I'll remember this!

00:21:21.810 --> 00:21:23.690
Officer, it's right here!

00:21:24.520 --> 00:21:25.260
Huh?

00:21:25.910 --> 00:21:28.310
There's nothin' wrong here.

00:21:28.310 --> 00:21:29.600
Grandmother!

00:21:29.600 --> 00:21:30.540
Aguri!

00:21:31.360 --> 00:21:32.570
Where's that monster?

00:21:32.880 --> 00:21:36.440
The Precures came and defeated it.

00:21:36.440 --> 00:21:37.770
Right, Mana?

00:21:37.770 --> 00:21:38.550
Yeah!

00:21:38.990 --> 00:21:40.520
Precures?

00:21:40.510 --> 00:21:43.820
Now, let's get back to our birthday party!

00:21:45.830 --> 00:21:47.770
Everyone's waiting!

00:21:54.010 --> 00:21:55.560
A birthday, huh?

00:22:09.010 --> 00:22:10.600
Aguri, what's wrong?

00:22:10.600 --> 00:22:14.130
It seems her grandmother found out she was Cure Ace!

00:22:14.130 --> 00:22:16.440
I can never return home again!

00:22:16.440 --> 00:22:18.150
Let's not jump the gun here!

00:22:18.150 --> 00:22:21.180
I'm sure your grandmother wouldn't want that either!

00:22:21.180 --> 00:22:22.480
What do you want to do, Aguri?

00:22:22.780 --> 00:22:25.690
I want to stay with Grandmother!

00:22:27.000 --> 00:22:27.950
<i>Dokidoki Precure</i>:

00:22:28.630 --> 00:22:31.760
To the Person I Love!

00:22:28.630 --> 00:22:31.760
To the Person I Love!

00:22:31.760 --> 00:22:33.830
That knot in your heart won't come undone!
